**No, definitely not!** 

`401 Unauthorized` is **not** an IP ban or soft ban. (An IP ban or rate limit would return `403 Forbidden`, `429 Too Many Requests`, or a connection timeout). `401` simply means the WebDAV server is expecting the API key formatted directly into the URL path.

TorBox WebDAV uses the URL format:
```text
https://webdav.torbox.app/<YOUR_API_KEY>/
```

